# JavaScript rules

## File structure

- Single app file: `assets/js/scripts-{timestamp}.js` (~10k lines)
- Wrapped in IIFE: `(function () { "use strict"; ... })()`
- Table of contents comment at top of file lists major areas
- Pathname helpers: `getPathname()`, `isHomePage()`, `isActivitiesPage()`, `isProjectsPage()`, `isPrayerTimesPage()`, `getPageKey()`
- **Two init hooks:** `DOMContentLoaded` (shared chrome + page-specific) and `window.onload` (API fetches, `setLocationSpecific()`)

## Site links

- `SITE_LINKS` — canonical external URLs; HTML uses `data-site-link="<key>"`
- `initCanonicalSiteLinks()` runs on every page `DOMContentLoaded`
- See `.cursor/rules/site-links.mdc` for label conventions

## UK dates

- Use `formatUkDate` / `formatGregorianFromRecord` — never `en-US` or `Month DD, YYYY` for display
- See `.cursor/rules/uk-date-format.mdc`

## UK times

- Use `formatUkDisplayTime` — 12-hour, no leading zero on hour, lowercase `am`/`pm`
- See `.cursor/rules/uk-time-format.mdc`

