## localStorage keys

`salahTimesAssetUrl`, `iqamah-today`, `kicc-announcements`, `kicc-notices`, `kicc-random-hadith`, `masjidProgrammes_programme_active_true_v1`, `kicc-campaign-progress`

## Page routing

### `DOMContentLoaded`

| Page | Extra init |
|------|------------|
| Home (`/` or `/index.html`) | `showNotices`, `initHomeNotices`, `initHomePillars` |
| `prayer-times.html` | `initPrayerTimesPage`, `initPrayerTimesPageMotion` |

All pages also run: `initSiteAnnouncements`, `initNavSalahPanel`, `initMobileNav`, `initPageSectionNavDock`, `initConsentEmbeds`, cookie/WhatsApp/footer chrome, page motion helpers (`initAboutPageMotion`, `initContactPageMotion`, `initCampaignPageMotion`, etc.), `initSumUpDonate`.

### `window.onload` → `setLocationSpecific()`

| Page | Init |
|------|------|
| Home | `setEvent`, `loadProgrammes` |
| `activities.html` | `setEvent`, `loadProgrammes` |
| `projects.html` | `initBaguetteBox` (`.grid-gallery`) |
| `prayer-times.html` | `initPrayerTimesPage` |

Always on `window.onload`: `setSalahTimeUrl`, `setSalahTimes`, `getRandomHadith`, `loadFundraiserProgress`, `scrollToLocationHash`.

## Prayer times page

- Root hook: `[data-prayer-times-page]`
- Key functions: `initPrayerTimesPage`, `initPrayerTimesPageMotion`, `printPrayerTimetableSheet`
- Month switcher: `[data-prayer-month-tabs]` (current + next month only)
- View tabs: day / week / month via `.prayer-times-view-tab`
- Uses shared salah data helpers (`loadPrayerDataWindow`, `getMonthsForDayRange`, etc.)

## Patterns to follow

```javascript
// Cache-then-fetch
const cached = localStorage.getItem(KEY);
if (cached) { /* apply to DOM */ }
fetch(url)
  .then(resp => resp.ok ? resp.json() : null)
  .then(json => { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(json)); /* update DOM */ })
  .catch(err => console.error("...", err));
```

## Do not

- Manually rename `scripts-*.js` or edit script `src` in HTML (gulp precommit handles this)
- Use `eval`, inline event handlers, or `innerHTML` with untrusted user input
- Add npm runtime dependencies — this is zero-dependency client JS

## Annual maintenance

Update hardcoded dates in `isRamadan()` and `isEid()` when Islamic calendar dates change (currently set for 2026).
